    @* Single UI typeface — Inter. Falls back to Segoe UI/system if it can't
       load (e.g. an offline station).
       display=optional (not swap) on purpose: `swap` re-flows every piece of
       text the moment the webfont arrives, which is the one-off "jump" seen on
       a cold cache. `optional` never swaps mid-page, so layout is stable; the
       font is used from the cache on every subsequent load. *@
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=optional" rel="stylesheet">

    @* Cascade order matters — each layer is allowed to refine the ones above it:
         vendor            Bootstrap, first so everything below can override it
         theme             design tokens (custom properties only)
         bootstrap-overrides  re-skins Bootstrap with those tokens
         base              document/element defaults
         components        .app-* UI primitives
         animations        shared keyframes + motion, refines the primitives
         pages/*           page-sized features
         *.styles.css      Blazor scoped component styles (always last)
       See css/theme.css for the full house rules. *@
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.13.1/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/theme.css?v=@AssetVersion" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/bootstrap-overrides.css?v=@AssetVersion" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/base.css?v=@AssetVersion" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/components.css?v=@AssetVersion" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/animations.css?v=@AssetVersion" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/pages/dashboard.css?v=@AssetVersion" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="WarehousePacking.Server.styles.css?v=@AssetVersion" />
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-FKyoEForCGlyvwx9Hj09JcYn3nv7wiPVlz7YYwJrWVcXK/BmnVDxM+D2scQbITxI" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <script src="js/utils.js?v=@AssetVersion"></script>
